# {{project_name}}

<!-- One or two sentences on what this project does and who it's for. -->

FastAPI backend in `backend/`, React single-page app in `frontend/`. The frontend's API types, query hooks, and test mocks are generated from the backend's OpenAPI spec.

## Quickstart

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), [bun](https://bun.sh), and make.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
make install
make dev        # API on :8000, web on :5173
```

Open http://localhost:5173. The web dev server proxies `/api` to the backend.

## Commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make dev` | Run API and web dev servers |
| `make lint` / `make format` | Check / fix lint and formatting |
| `make typecheck` | mypy + tsc |
| `make test` | Backend and frontend tests |
| `make coverage` | Tests with coverage thresholds |
| `make build` | Production frontend build |
| `make generate-api` | Regenerate the typed API client after backend changes |
| `make e2e` | Playwright end-to-end tests |

Run `make help` for the full list.

## Layout

```
backend/    FastAPI app (app/), tests, pyproject.toml
frontend/   React Router SPA (app/), tests, generated API client
```

